      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c52916ce72f179dd",
      "translationZh": "终于在我的 M4Pro 48GB Mac 上跑起来了 3.8-Flash-Next，用的是 https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5539b4409ae862f5",
      "translationZh": "稠密模型 3.8-27B 就是更快……而且可能因为量化级别的缘故，效果也更好……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3b10f9e86a296ff",
      "translationZh": "等一下，在 llama.cpp 中设置了一些关键参数后，Flash-Next 实际上跑得比 27B 更快。它能撑到 131K 而不发生内存不足……也许吧……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
